# The production image is built from the repository root; send only the two apps.
# The dev stage (context app/backend, infra/compose.dev.yaml) copies nothing from its context.
*
!app/backend/
!app/frontend/

app/frontend/node_modules
app/frontend/dist
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/bin/
**/coverage.out
**/*_test.go
